Let \vec a, \vec b, \vec c and \vec y be the three
dimensional vectors
\vec a = 4\,\mathit{\vec j}+2\,\mathit{\vec k},\quad \vec b = 5\,\mathit{\vec i}+7\,\mathit{\vec j}+4\,\mathit{\vec k},\quad \vec c = 4\,\mathit{\vec i}-2\,\mathit{\vec j},\quad \vec y = -4\,\mathit{\vec i}-5\,\mathit{\vec j}
